es.\n- **Git State:** The local repository is fully up to date with `origin/main` after the recent `git pull`.\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n- **`import_snn.js`** *(Edited)*: Completely rewritten to map all Excel columns and format them as `Key::Value\\\\n`.\n- **`prisma/schema.prisma`** *(Edited)*: Added implicit N-N relation arrays: `nhiemVus NhiemVu[] @relation(\"HeThongNhiemVu\")` and `heThongSos HeThongSo[] @relation(\"HeThongNhiemVu\")`.\n- **`src/app/api/nhiem-vu/route.ts` & `src/app/api/nhiem-vu/[id]/route.ts`** *(Edited)*: Updated POST and PUT handlers to accept `heThongSoIds` and use Prisma's `connect`/`set` to build relations.\n- **`src/types/index.ts`** *(Edited)*: Added optional arrays `nhiemVus` and `heThongSos` to the respective data interfaces.\n- **`src/app/admin/nhiem-vu/page.tsx`** *(Edited)*: Added `fetch(\"/api/he-thong\")` to populate a `<Select mode=\"multiple\">` for linking `HeThongSo` to the task.\n- **`src/app/(portal)/layout.tsx`** *(Edited)*: Replaced `navItems` with a centered `<Segmented>` component using `router.push()` to switch between `/kts/hien-trang` and `/kts/lo-trinh`.\n- **`src/app/(portal)/kts/hien-trang/page.tsx`** *(Edited)*: Parses `moTa` via `.split(/\\\\n/)`. Added a section at the bottom of the `<Descriptions>` to display linked `nhiemVus`. Hid the old page header.\n- **`src/app/(portal)/kts/lo-trinh/page.tsx`** *(Edited)*: Added a sub-section in the \"Nhiệm vụ\" table column to display small tags for all linked `heThongSos`. Hid the old page header.\n\n## 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n**Immediate Context:**\nThe user's manager sent a screenshot of an IOC Dashboard from the Department of Science and Technology. The user just asked: *\"nhưng hình trên có phải là Khung Kiến trúc Số của tỉnh theo quyết định ko\"* (Is the image above the Digital Architecture Framework of the province?).\n\n**Next Steps:**\n1. Reply directly to the user to clarify the difference between a general Departmental Operations Dashboard (IOC) and a sp